    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>CONTROLS:</strong></u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Z] = Shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Arrow Keys] = Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>INFO:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Intergalactic Hyperdimensional Cheerleading Championship (IHCC)! It's a competition, so aim for the highest score possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>CHEER SQUAD</i></strong> is a simple, top-down, vertically scrolling, manic shooter where you shoot down wave after endless wave of superpowered cheerleaders while gracefully maneuvering through an onslaught of pom-pom bullets! The easy-to-learn scoring system makes this shoot 'em up ideal for playing in short, action-packed bursts. Like the arcade classics of old, the game is short, sweet, and to the point, with no downtime during the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Chamber Software's first publicly released video game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>CONTROLS:</strong></u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Z] = Shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Arrow Keys] = Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>INFO:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Intergalactic Hyperdimensional Cheerleading Championship (IHCC)! It's a competition, so aim for the highest score possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>CHEER SQUAD</i></strong> is a simple, top-down, vertically scrolling, manic shooter where you shoot down wave after endless wave of superpowered cheerleaders while gracefully maneuvering through an onslaught of pom-pom bullets! The easy-to-learn scoring system makes this shoot 'em up ideal for playing in short, action-packed bursts. Like the arcade classics of old, the game is short, sweet, and to the point, with no downtime during the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Chamber Software's first publicly released video game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing.</p>",
    "short_description": "Shoot for the stars and help Latte train in her quest to become the top cheerleader in the universe! Use your Pom-Pom Blasts to pummel the competition while dancing through a downpour of endlessly raining enemy bullets! Ready? Aim. Fire!",
